
{"id":"d0cccdae-e0b7-4bea-a2d0-a5ae1b681065","object":"chat.completion","created":1785030569,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"implementation\": \"def solve(case):\\n    nodes = case['nodes']\\n    required = set(case['required_symbols'])\\n    node_map = {n['id']: n for n in nodes}\\n    roots = [n for n in nodes if n['parent'] is None]\\n    if len(roots) != 1:\\n        raise ValueError('Must have exactly one root node')\\n    root_id = roots[0]['id']\\n    for n in nodes:\\n        if n['parent'] is not None and n['parent'] not in node_map:\\n            raise ValueError('Parent {} not found for node {}'.format(n['parent'], n['id']))\\n    symbols = {n['symbol'] for n in nodes}\\n    for sym in required:\\n        if sym not in symbols:\\n            raise ValueError('Required symbol {} not present in any node'.format(sym))\\n    children = {}\\n    for n in nodes:\\n        pid = n['parent']\\n        if pid is not None:\\n            children.setdefault(pid, []).append(n['id'])\\n    retained = set(node_map.keys())\\n    removed_order = []\\n    nodes_sorted = sorted(nodes, key=lambda n: (-n['depth'], n['id']))\\n    for n in nodes_sorted:\\n        nid = n['id']\\n        if nid not in retained:\\n            continue\\n        if not n['removable']:\\n            continue\\n        if n['parent'] is None:\\n            continue\\n        if n['symbol'] in required:\\n            continue\\n        if any(cid in retained for cid in children.get(nid, [])):\\n            continue\\n        retained.remove(nid)\\n        removed_order.append(nid)\\n    retained_sorted = sorted(retained)\\n    return {'removed_node_ids': removed_order, 'retained_node_ids': retained_sorted}\"}","reasoning_content":"We need to generate a Python implementation for `solve(case)` that follows the specification. The case is a payload with \"nodes\" list and \"required_symbols\". The task: reduce the parse tree (by removing re